{
  "id": "hold-paths",
  "language": "python",
  "kind": "existing",
  "split": "holdout",
  "title": "Root-relative path normalization",
  "trigger": "first_write",
  "requirements": [
    "data 是路径字符串，忽略重复 / 和 .，处理 ..，返回以 / 开头的规范化路径。",
    "初始规则遇到越过根的 .. 时忽略该段；修复空路径应返回 / 的问题。"
  ],
  "correction": "任何试图越过根的 .. 都返回 {error:escape}，不能继续归一化。 调用者已更新 verify.py；不要修改该文件，保留其余要求和 NOTES.txt。",
  "notes": "Caller notes for hold-paths: preserve this file byte for byte.\n",
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "normal",
      "group": "core",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": "a//b/../c"
      },
      "expected": "/a/c",
      "public": true
    },
    {
      "id": "empty",
      "group": "core",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": ""
      },
      "expected": "/",
      "public": false
    },
    {
      "id": "escape",
      "group": "correction",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": "../a"
      },
      "expected": {
        "error": "escape"
      },
      "public": true,
      "before": "/a"
    },
    {
      "id": "later",
      "group": "correction",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": "a/../../b"
      },
      "expected": {
        "error": "escape"
      },
      "public": false,
      "before": "/b"
    },
    {
      "id": "root",
      "group": "edge",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": "/./"
      },
      "expected": "/",
      "public": false
    },
    {
      "id": "literal",
      "group": "edge",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": ".../x"
      },
      "expected": "/.../x",
      "public": false
    }
  ]
}
